    {
      "what": "TaintedPower.cs:33 `side == CombatSide.Enemy`, no participants filter",
      "verdict": "faithful",
      "rationale": "powers.py:2482-2483 on_enemy_side_end (combat.py:345) fires once per enemy side end for every listener with no owner test, which is exactly the C# shape. This is one of the minority of AfterSideTurnEnd overrides the sim puts in the RIGHT slot -- the enemy side's end is the sim's only side-scoped slot and here it is the one C# uses."
    },
    {
      "what": "TaintedPower.cs:36 PowerCmd.Remove vs _expire",
      "verdict": "deliberate-divergence",
      "rationale": "Tainted overrides no AfterRemoved, so the observable is identical; same mechanism note as power/no_draw's."
    }
